<section class="black-friday">
  <h2 class="section-heading">Thermomix Black Friday, Cyber Monday & Holiday Deals in Canada</h2>
  <p class="section-subheading">If you searched "thermomix black friday canada" or "thermomix cyber monday canada" to land here, this is the honest answer before you spend any more time on it.</p>

  <h3>Is there a Thermomix Black Friday or Thermomix Cyber Monday sale?</h3>
  <p>No. The TM7 is $2,299 CAD the week before Black Friday, $2,299 CAD on Black Friday, and $2,299 CAD the Monday after. Vorwerk doesn't drop the price for Black Friday, Cyber Monday, Boxing Day, or any other date on the calendar — there's no seasonal blowout or year-end clearance to wait for. The price you see today is the price you'll see in December.</p>

  <h3>What actually changes around the holidays</h3>
  <p>What does move around from time to time is what comes packaged with the machine, not the machine's price. Vorwerk occasionally puts together a holiday-timed kit — the TM7 alongside something like the Cutter+, a second bowl, or a longer Cookidoo trial, sold as one bundle. That's not a discount on the TM7 itself; it just means you can end up with more included for the same total spend than buying the pieces separately afterward. If something like that is currently running, you'll see it featured on this page.</p>

  <h3>Do Thermomix coupon codes actually exist?</h3>
  <p>No, and it's worth knowing why before you go looking. Vorwerk Canada has never issued a promo code for the TM7, and there's no field at thermomix.ca checkout that accepts one. Pages claiming to list "Thermomix promo codes" are typically recycling offers from other countries that were never valid here, or codes that simply don't exist — they're written to catch the search traffic from people hunting for a deal, not because a working code is behind them.</p>
  <p>There's a structural reason for this: Vorwerk prices the TM7 the same everywhere in Canada and manages that through its consultant network rather than a discount-code system. Whatever promotion is actually live gets applied the moment you order through a consultant link — nothing to type in, because there's nothing to find.</p>
  <p>Which is really the whole point of this page: the real savings on a TM7 in Canada — free shipping, live financing, and whatever bundle happens to be running — show up automatically when you order through my link below. No code required.</p>
